        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): resolve legacy modelstudio profile aliases",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\r\n\r\nFixes #84081: legacy explicit auth profile ids like `modelstudio:default` fail to resolve after provider canonicalization to `qwen`, causing `No credentials found for profile \"modelstudio:default\"` even when `qwen:default` exists in the auth store.\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n- Retry explicit legacy provider-prefixed profile ids through `resolveProviderIdForAuth` when direct lookup misses (resolver fallback in `model-auth.ts`).\r\n- Add production Qwen manifest aliases: `modelstudio` → `qwen`, `qwencloud` → `qwen` in `extensions/qwen/openclaw.plugin.json` (required for the fallback to work outside mocked tests).\r\n- Preserve explicit profile precedence: if `modelstudio:default` exists directly, it wins over `qwen:default`.\r\n\r\n## Evidence\r\n\r\nRepro path (before): store has only `qwen:default`, request `{ provider: \"modelstudio\", profileId: \"modelstudio:default\" }` → throws `No credentials found for profile \"modelstudio:default\"`.\r\n\r\nAfter this patch (vitest, production manifest aliases + resolver fallback):\r\n\r\n```\r\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs \\\r\n  src/agents/model-auth.profiles.test.ts \\\r\n  src/agents/provider-auth-aliases.test.ts \\\r\n  src/agents/model-auth.modelstudio-profile-alias.test.ts \\\r\n  -t \"84081|modelstudio profile\" --run\r\n\r\n Test Files  6 passed (6)\r\n      Tests  10 passed | 150 skipped (160)\r\n```\r\n\r\nKey assertions in `model-auth.modelstudio-profile-alias.test.ts` (no mocked alias map):\r\n- `profileId: \"modelstudio:default\"` + store `{ \"qwen:default\": ... }` → resolves to `qwen:default`, key `qwen-key`\r\n- store with both `modelstudio:default` and `qwen:default` → keeps explicit `modelstudio:default`\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n\r\n- [x] `provider-auth-aliases.test.ts` — reads bundled `extensions/qwen/openclaw.plugin.json`, asserts `modelstudio`/`qwencloud` → `qwen`\r\n- [x] `model-auth.modelstudio-profile-alias.test.ts` — end-to-end `resolveApiKeyForProvider` with production manifest snapshot\r\n- [x] `model-auth.profiles.test.ts` — alias fallback + explicit-profile precedence\r\n- [ ] CI green\r\n\r\nFixes #84081\r\n",
